### VedaAI backend manual tests
### Use the VS Code "REST Client" extension or JetBrains HTTP client.
### Variables update automatically as you run requests in order.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@assignmentId = REPLACE_AFTER_CREATE

### 0. Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 1. Create assignment (no file)
# Captures the assignment id printed in the JSON response.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----vedaai

------vedaai
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Photosynthesis Quiz
------vedaai
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="subject"

Biology
------vedaai
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="gradeLevel"

Class 10
------vedaai
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="dueDate"

2026-12-31T23:59:00.000Z
------vedaai
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="additionalInstructions"

Keep questions student-friendly.
------vedaai
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="questionConfigs"

[{"type":"mcq","count":3,"marksPerQuestion":2,"difficultyMix":{"easy":50,"moderate":50,"hard":0}},{"type":"short_answer","count":2,"marksPerQuestion":5,"difficultyMix":{"easy":0,"moderate":100,"hard":0}}]
------vedaai--

### 2. List
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments?limit=10

### 3. Get one
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/{{assignmentId}}

### 4. Poll paper
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/paper

### 5. Regenerate
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/regenerate

### 6. PDF (first call queues a render, returns 202)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/pdf?studentName=Anish&rollNumber=42&section=A

### 7. Validation: missing title
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----v

------v
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="dueDate"

2026-12-31T23:59:00.000Z
------v
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="questionConfigs"

[{"type":"mcq","count":1,"marksPerQuestion":1}]
------v--

### 8. Not found
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/000000000000000000000000

### 9. Bad id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/not-an-id
